      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "WHAT ARE YOUR DATA PROTECTION RIGHTS?\r\nOur Company would like to make
    sure you are fully aware of all your data protection rights.\r\nEvery user is
    entitled to the following:\r\nThe right to access \u2013 You have the right to
    request UnMerryChristmas for copies of your\r\npersonal data. We may charge you
    a small fee for this service.\r\nThe right to rectification \u2013 You have the
    right to request that UnMerryChristmas correct any\r\ninformation you believe
    is inaccurate. You also have the right to request UnMerryChristmas to\r\ncomplete
    the information you believe is incomplete."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 05f1775dfe1cd6b44ae9053c5f6d8b29, type: 2}
