  m_text: "HOW DO WE USE COOKIES?\r\nUnMerryChristmas uses cookies in a range of
    ways to improve your experience while playing, including:\r\n\u2022 Keeping track
    of game status\r\n\u2022 Allowing you to save the game\r\n\u2022 Understanding
    how you play our game\n\r\nWHAT TYPES OF COOKIES DO WE USE?\r\nThere are a number
    of different types of cookies, however, our website uses:\r\n\u2022 Functionality
    \u2013 Our game uses these cookies so that we can save your current game status
    every time you save and/or load or game, allowing you to keep track of each\r\ngame."
