  m_text: "HOW DO WE COLLECT YOUR DATA?\nUnMerryChristmas implements Unity Analytics
    Essential Data collection, which provides us with most of the data we collect.
    You give access to this data when you install and use our game.\n\nHOW WILL WE
    USE YOUR DATA?\r\nUnMerryChristmas collects your data so that we can:\r\n\u2022
    Analyze game performance\r\n\u2022 Understand player behavior\r\n\u2022 Enhance
    player experience"
